923	     * static arguments fArgs and gArgs the classes of parent match: each of
924	     * f's that matches a type that is no static parameter, that type; each
925	     * class of two type parameters or more, one type parameter made afresh,
926	     * whose bounds are every bound of each, each read in an environment where
927	     * its declaration's static parameters stand for their arguments at the
928	     * overlap, as createSymbolicInstantiation reads a declaration's bounds;
929	     * any other static parameter of f, itself.  Null where a class holds two
930	     * different types.
